{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structure imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/trust_me_small.gif?t=1744053628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/build_all_small_v3.gif?t=1744053628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Twist and turn the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/extras/climb_all_small_v2.gif?t=1744053628\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each other in different ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each level you will be able to compare your score with all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215120?t=1744053628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215120?t=1744053628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215120/ead1f5d2a8e03cb49ab7165e655a84d82f45cb44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744053628","capsule_imagev5":"